{"data":[{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-04-30T17:53:37.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2049910055223652436"],"id":"2049910055223652436","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":2283,"like_count":26,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":14,"retweet_count":1},"text":"但我说白了我是一个就算有五斗米了也要为十斗米折腰的人，面子之类的东西是我给自己找的台阶，我赚不到钱，我就装作不屑一顾说我不稀罕那种钱，实际上想赚得要命","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2049910055223652436"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-04-30T13:30:12.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2049843767025574039"],"id":"2049843767025574039","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":12,"impression_count":10983,"like_count":104,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":4},"text":"如果真的有一天我不爱你了，那我不会再去相信永远。 https://t.co/S2RVpiTHVB","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2049843767025574039"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-04-30T10:11:06.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2049793658413862932"],"id":"2049793658413862932","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":1855,"like_count":22,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":3,"retweet_count":0},"text":"我真的很难做到劳逸结合，要不就是启动困难导致一点事都不做，要不就是猛猛做事好几个小时根本停不下来，完全忽略时间的流逝⋯","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2049793658413862932"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-04-30T02:34:15.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2049678690951549097"],"id":"2049678690951549097","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":3,"impression_count":4663,"like_count":76,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":7,"retweet_count":6},"text":"人类俩字长得和大粪一样，其实本质也一样","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2049678690951549097"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-04-29T13:28:39.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2049480987638398990"],"id":"2049480987638398990","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":20,"impression_count":124320,"like_count":644,"quote_count":4,"reply_count":66,"retweet_count":17},"text":"你说，这是为什么呢 https://t.co/MN85Ahr3a1","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2049480987638398990"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-04-29T10:57:21.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2049442909532135700"],"id":"2049442909532135700","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":5,"impression_count":6302,"like_count":125,"quote_count":3,"reply_count":10,"retweet_count":18},"text":"你最近过的怎么样 有没有把痛苦当玩笑讲","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2049442909532135700"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-04-29T10:52:38.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2049441724620235208"],"id":"2049441724620235208","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":9776,"like_count":135,"quote_count":2,"reply_count":8,"retweet_count":6},"text":"如果有个人太合你心意太让你喜欢，那一定是针对你的杀猪盘，小说里都这么写的。","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2049441724620235208"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-04-28T17:37:09.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2049181135465263383"],"id":"2049181135465263383","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":10,"impression_count":24789,"like_count":293,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":34,"retweet_count":17},"text":"比被出轨更可怜的是 你翻看他手机 发现他到处搭讪撩骚 却被以各种方式拒绝 这种没人要的玩意儿却在你手里","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2049181135465263383"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-04-28T16:18:52.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2049161436254081415"],"id":"2049161436254081415","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":36,"impression_count":61514,"like_count":1378,"quote_count":12,"reply_count":19,"retweet_count":235},"text":"焦虑这个情绪真是前无古人后无来者得贱啊，不管处于什么状态，幸福快乐还是崩溃痛苦，焦虑都是直接开团秒跟的，就，感觉焦虑是一种上帝，一种老天，看见你动弹一下，立刻觉得你活美了要给你找麻烦","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2049161436254081415"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-04-28T12:30:38.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2049103999195086900"],"id":"2049103999195086900","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":6,"impression_count":65902,"like_count":346,"quote_count":6,"reply_count":20,"retweet_count":57},"text":"我的价值观就是给我钱的都是特别特别好的人","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2049103999195086900"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-04-28T10:51:53.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2049079148984017253"],"id":"2049079148984017253","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":69,"impression_count":157206,"like_count":3880,"quote_count":49,"reply_count":82,"retweet_count":212},"text":"想强迫别人听你歌单的可以去当出租车司机","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2049079148984017253"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-04-28T10:39:37.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2049076060323799242"],"id":"2049076060323799242","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":2406,"like_count":19,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":3},"text":"我总是想这样的人，这样的感情，这样的生活，还要继续多久呢？","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2049076060323799242"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-04-28T10:39:25.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2049076011246198907"],"id":"2049076011246198907","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":2687,"like_count":24,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":3,"retweet_count":1},"text":"跟前任大吵一架的话，我一定吵不过他的。因为每次都没吵赢过，我总是忘记他做了什么事让我生气，让我不开心。\n每当这个时候他就会说，你看你自己都说不清我到底干啥了让你生气，天天就知道找我茬。\n我恨自己，恨自己记性太差，总是忘记他的不好，记住的只有他那零星几点的好。","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2049076011246198907"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-04-28T10:16:02.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2049070126616682621"],"id":"2049070126616682621","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":1758,"like_count":13,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":0},"text":"其实昨天晚上又开始幻听幻视耳鸣，清醒过来又因为药效开始做一些匪夷所思的事情，早上醒来翻聊天记录试图想起来到底做了什么，但什么都没想起来。","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2049070126616682621"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-04-28T10:12:24.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2049069211193102765"],"id":"2049069211193102765","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":2592,"like_count":21,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":3,"retweet_count":0},"text":"我特别特别讨厌吃东西吃撑了的感觉，我每次吃饱了之后，我的父母我的身边的人总让我再多吃一点，我只好把自己吃到撑到快吐了再停止，就好像我这样做他们会开心一点","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2049069211193102765"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-04-28T10:08:46.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2049068298063728712"],"id":"2049068298063728712","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":2927,"like_count":42,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":7,"retweet_count":7},"text":"我不知道从什么时候开始我连我的表达欲也失去了","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2049068298063728712"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-04-28T10:08:10.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2049068144556417473"],"id":"2049068144556417473","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":5541,"like_count":101,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":5,"retweet_count":15},"text":"我根本不想找这个专业的工作然后也根本找不到好吗好的我人生唯一心愿就是画点我喜欢的小人然后死掉","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2049068144556417473"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-04-28T10:04:10.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2049067139278266608"],"id":"2049067139278266608","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":7,"impression_count":11123,"like_count":225,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":11,"retweet_count":42},"text":"请多一些莫名其妙吧，事情莫名其妙就解决了，莫名其妙就出现转机了，好运气莫名奇妙就降临了，生活莫名其妙就变得更顺利更好了。","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2049067139278266608"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-04-28T08:50:05.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2049048493923471533"],"id":"2049048493923471533","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":35,"impression_count":56036,"like_count":1581,"quote_count":18,"reply_count":39,"retweet_count":281},"text":"我真觉得我在崩溃后吐露情绪的样子特别恶心，特别咯噔，特别做作，但我控制不住","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2049048493923471533"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-04-28T08:47:00.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2049047718002315610"],"id":"2049047718002315610","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":2,"impression_count":15780,"like_count":89,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":16,"retweet_count":4},"text":"每次看小玩具的时候我都觉得想要轻松点打飞机付出的成本也太他妈大了","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2049047718002315610"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-04-28T06:35:30.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2049014626000810204"],"id":"2049014626000810204","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":3,"impression_count":3900,"like_count":80,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":8},"text":"我也可以对你好，和你在一起，无条件奉上我的一切除了真心。但这种因为愧疚得来的爱真的是你想要的吗？真的是我无条件可以付出的吗？所以不要再质问我一个答案了。有些事情不是说说就能就改变的。有的感情又怎么可能像你想的这么简单。你觉得我是烂人，那我只会说好。","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2049014626000810204"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-04-28T06:35:19.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2049014580731695573"],"id":"2049014580731695573","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":2907,"like_count":32,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":4,"retweet_count":2},"text":"我这个烂人，不也让你觉得我对你的好无可挑剔吗？\n那你呢，是喜欢我，还是喜欢我对你的好？","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2049014580731695573"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-04-27T17:18:34.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2048814070665822710"],"id":"2048814070665822710","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":3,"impression_count":4472,"like_count":85,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":7,"retweet_count":7},"text":"你有什么事都告诉我，我要给你添乱^ ^","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2048814070665822710"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-04-27T16:27:29.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2048801214654283873"],"id":"2048801214654283873","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":38,"impression_count":56501,"like_count":1045,"quote_count":7,"reply_count":24,"retweet_count":261},"text":"不要再说那些让我误以为我很重要的话了","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2048801214654283873"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-04-27T14:48:10.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2048776221950103662"],"id":"2048776221950103662","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":5869,"like_count":95,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":13,"retweet_count":3},"text":"你遇见的大部分人都没有你撸管用的卫生纸重要","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2048776221950103662"}],"includes":{"users":[{"id":"1917047326990094336","name":"kiri","profile_image_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1917047544313679872/akAJkXe1_normal.jpg","username":"0TwT012","verified":false}]},"meta":{"newest_id":"2049910055223652436","next_token":"b26v89c19zqg8o3juekjxl89o4o1tsdklu4dyf9bg5app","oldest_id":"2048776221950103662","result_count":25}}